        "Horia Petre Costin",
        "Luca-Andrei Glavan",
        "Antonio-Daniel Corlatescu"
      ],
      "doi": "10.3390/ijms241310809",
      "source": "International Journal of Molecular Sciences",
      "title": "Unraveling Molecular and Genetic Insights into Neurodegenerative Diseases: Advances in Understanding Alzheimer’s, Parkinson’s, and Huntington’s Diseases and Amyotrophic Lateral Sclerosis",
      "work_id": "doi:10.3390/ijms241310809",
      "year": 2023
    }
